{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16217790","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16217790","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1621779001:1":{"text":"助けてくれて、本当にありがとうございました。","source_cn":"谢谢，谢谢你们救了我。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC27486CD592EFC19","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621779002:1":{"text":"昨晩、ずっと考えていました……現実は確かに厳しい、鏡人が言う理想の自分として生きるのも悪くないと……","source_cn":"昨天晚上我想了很久……虽然现实很艰难，虽然我也很向往镜...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0E4E706244828943","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621779003:1":{"text":"でも、やっぱり僕が命を投げ出すのは違います。","source_cn":"但是，果然还是要活下去啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x257780CF615F2CF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1621779004:1":{"text":"たとえ才能がなく、メイジの頂点に到達できない運命だったとしても……少なくとも魔法は使えるし、何より研究そのものが好きですからね。","source_cn":"就算天资平庸，注定无法走到魔法的顶端……但至少，我还能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4BAF070D3D5C63C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1621779005:1":{"text":"これからも努力を続ければ、自分に合った分野が見つかり、新たな理想の生き方も見つかるかもしれません！","source_cn":"我会继续努力学习，找到自己适合的领域，以自己想要的方式...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBEF104E20E3461E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1621779006:1":{"text":"やった、ジロードが前向きになってきたぞ！","source_cn":"吉罗德的心态变得积极了好多！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE66F0187D3348A82","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1621779007:1":{"text":"生死の境を経験したことで悟ったのかもね。まさに災い転じて福となすだ！","source_cn":"应该是在生死边境走过一遭后，就想通了吧？因祸得福啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xED087547BF1000ED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1621779008:1":{"text":"大人ぶって、難しい言葉を使おうとしなくていいの。何も分かってないくせに。","source_cn":"笨蛋利奥，明明自己也都什么不懂，还装作大人说深奥的话。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0D8022E3A2BE94E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1621779009:1":{"text":"まあでも……実際その通りなんだけどね。","source_cn":"不过有一件事你说得对，的确是因祸得福。虽然整件事很惊险...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x5810401948A78CEA","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"まあでも……実際その通りなんだけどね。","female":"まあでも……実際その通りなんだけどね。","variant_male_record_index":"207898","variant_female_record_index":"207899","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1621779010:1":{"text":"提案なんだけど……美味しいものを食べながら、ジロードの新たな門出を祝うってのはどうかな！？","source_cn":"我提议——去餐厅吃顿好的，庆祝吉罗德的新生！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7398003F0C6F2C4D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"